From 33bac7af455fc69ec036b895c0fa58578db2e8bd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bench <bench@local>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 00:42:29 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] null patch: 58-section-store

Chunk sections are Arc<Section>, immutable, stored once per process by content (hash, then full comparison). An edit copies the section and stores the result; a frame's edits to one section are stored once. Shared-mode behaviour is unchanged.

Vanilla: LevelChunk#setBlockState, ClientPacketListener#handleBlockUpdate / #handleChunkBlocksUpdate. Grim: the collision and prediction checks read the same blocks.
